  "repositoryControlledGaps": [
    "Compose a versioned independently issued local-model authorization/control contract; current public component records validate fields and equality but do not prove issuer signatures or bind all feature authorization IDs/token/deadline terms.",
    "Implement a local model driver that acquires and proves actual weights, tokenizer/runtime/device identity and physical memory grants before claiming isolated local inference.",
    "Compose trusted later missing-usage reconciliation and authenticated journal archival/retention; exact thread/read terminal recovery already exists but cannot manufacture unavailable ephemeral history or usage.",
